        <mxCell id="o_gen" value='&lt;b&gt;generate.mjs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:11px"&gt;1 build provenance-codegen (cargo --locked)&lt;br&gt;2 export into a temporary folder&lt;br&gt;3 exactQuerySuccesses; grammar-lint&lt;br&gt;4 typescript.mjs (openapi-typescript),&lt;br&gt;   effect.mjs (@effect/openapi-generator),&lt;br&gt;   validators.mjs (Ajv standalone)&lt;br&gt;5 rust (typify), templates.mjs client, rustfmt&lt;br&gt;6 size check; write the receipt;&lt;br&gt;   --check runs twice and compares&lt;/font&gt;' style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;absoluteArcSize=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1a1a1a;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="oc">
